Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: __SIZE__
Maintainer: Mert Berkan Kalkan <mertberkankalkan@gmail.com>
Depends: libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1
Recommends: libsecret-tools, libnotify-bin
Homepage: https://github.com/mbKalkan/GitAlert
Description: GitHub alerts in the tray
 GitAlert watches the repositories and the inbox you point it at and says what
 changed - pushes, pull requests, issues, CI runs, releases, mentions - from an
 icon in the panel, with a window that groups the alerts by project and shows
 the diff behind each one.
